    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277000</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いらっしゃいませ、
道具屋「スパイシー」へようこそ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Come on in. Welcome to
the item shop, "Spicy".</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277004</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277008</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ありがとうございました。
またのご来店、お待ちしております</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thank you very much. I sincerely
hope you'll shop with us again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277012</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>外は暑いけど
屋内は涼しいの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's hot outside, but
nice and cool in here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277012</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>だから、ずっと中にいるのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hence why I've stayed
here for so long.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ～すずしー。
買うものは何もないけど
お邪魔してるの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aaah, how refreshing~. I'm
not even here to shop, but I
spend all my time here anyway.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277016</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>外は暑いからね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's just so
hot outside,
you know?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ちょっとこの街は
暑すぎよね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This town's a
little bit too
hot, isn't it?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277020</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>おかげで
街の木々も枯れてぐったりよ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe that's why
all the trees look
so dry and listless?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277024</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>暑いと木や花も
ぐったりなっちゃうのね。
驚きだわ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even the trees and flowers
feel listless in the heat, huh?
I'm a little shocked, really!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>外が暑すぎて
一歩たりともここから
出られないの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It way too hot outside.
I don't want to take even
single step out there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ふぁ～
すずしー……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Aaah... How
refreshing~...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277032</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>外が暑くて外に出られない、
すなわちお家に帰れない……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's too hot to go outside, but...
In that case, I can't go home...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277032</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そろそろ家に帰らないと
お家の人に怒られるかも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My family will probably get
mad if I don't hurry back soon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オリーブとれないのに
なぜかオリーブヴィレッジ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You won't find any olives around
here, but for some reason,
it's still called Olive Village.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277036</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでだろーな
ナゾだ～、まったくナゾだ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why, why, why is that? It's a
mystery! A big, big mystery~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>砂漠なのに
水が湧き続けてるんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're in the desert, but the
water just keeps gushing up.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277040</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでだろーな
ナゾだ～、大変なナゾだ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why, why, why is that? It's a
mystery! A big, big mystery~!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>街の木々が枯れかかってる～。
なんでだろ～
なんでかな～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The trees in town are all drying up~.
But why~? Why, why, why is that~?
</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277044</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>水をやっても
戻らないよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Even if you water them,
they get drier and drier~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>石になってるのは
なんで人間だけなの～？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But why, why is it only the
humans who turn to stone~?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277048</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>魔物は石にならないの
なんでだろ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The monsters never turn to
stone! Why, why, why is that~?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでなんで？
どうしてこの街は
砂だらけなの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why, why, why? Why
is this town covered in
so, sooo much sand?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277052</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>掘っても掘っても
どこまでも砂なの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If I dig and dig and dig, will
I still find nothing but sand?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんで世界はこんなに
ふしぎなことばっかなの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But why, why is everything in
this world so, soo mysterious?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでみんな
疑問に思わないで
生きてられるの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How and *why* does everyone
just accept it all and go on
living? With no doubts at all!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277056</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんでなんで～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why, why? Why is that~?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
