      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>またのお越しをお待ちしておりまぁす</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I sincerely hoope you'll
come by agaaain.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>野を越え、山越え三千里、
旅を続け、流れ流れて
次は砂漠</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We've gone over fields, over mountains,
thousands of miles, traveling on, drifting
and drifting, and now we're in the desert.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そろそろどこかの街に
ちゃんと住みたい……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I want to settle down and
start living in a town already...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277084</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お友達がほしい！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I want to make friends!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私はお父さんとともに
ずっと旅を続けているの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've been traveling around
with my dad for a long time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277088</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お父さんは地勢学者で
いろんなところの
石や土を調べるのが仕事なんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My dad's a geologist, so it's his
job to study the rocks and soil
from all kinds of different places.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私、お父さんと一緒に
ずっと旅を続けているんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've traveled around with
my dad for a long time.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277092</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、私もそろそろ
お父さんから独立して、
一人で暮らしたいよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, I want to strike
off and live on my
own sometime soon.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私のお父さんは
“転勤族”って言って
色んなところで働いてるの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My dad's job involves a lot
of traveling. He does work
in lots of different places.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277096</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、せっかくできたお友達と
別れたくないよ～</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, I worked so hard to make
friends. I don't wanna leave them~</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私、このお店で働いて
お金を貯めて
お父さんから独立するの</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So I'm going to work at this
shop, save up some money, and
then I'll strike off on my own.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277100</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お父さんと一緒に仕事を転々と
しなくても済むように！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That way, I won't have to move
around for my dad's work anymore!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>43</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いらっしゃいませ～
何かご注文は～……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Welcooome~! What
can I do for you~...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277104</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どう？　様になってる？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>How was that? Did
I sound the part?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>45</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277108</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私は世界の地理を
調べて回っているものです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm a traveler who studies
the world's geography.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277108</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この前行った、
スルト深林というところは、
奇妙なところでした</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Surt Deepwoods,
where I went before, are
a very strange place.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>47</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>スルト深林はそれほど
凶暴な魔物もいませんが、
何か奇妙な感じなのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There aren't any terribly strong
monsters there, yet something
about it still feels quite strange.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ところどころ土の錆の含有量が
高かったり、どことなく空気に
刺激臭があったり……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The soil in certain spots contains an
unusually high concentration of rust,
and there's this faint, sharp odor...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277112</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あれは以前にも、
どこかで嗅いだ覚えのある
匂いです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I know I've smelled
the exact same scent
before, somewhere.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>49</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>スルト深林で嗅いだ匂いは
あれは瘴気です、
魔界のことわりでできたガス</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What I smelled in the Surt Deepwoods was
miasma. It's a gas which forms naturally in
Daemonium—and a sign of daemons.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ご存知ですか？
しかし、どうしてあの森に瘴気が？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you familiar with it?
Though, why would there
be miasma in those woods?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>52</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277120</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>以前、スルト深林で瘴気の気配が
感じたのは、魔物が出てきたこと
と関係あるのでしょうか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I wonder if there's some relationship
between the monsters which appeared
and the traces of miasma I noticed before.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277120</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>魔物は、もともと魔界のもの
だったという話も
あるくらいですから</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>After all, it's been said that the
origins of all monsters can be
traced back to Daemonium.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>54</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>娘がこの村に住むと
言っているのです！
どうしましょう！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My daughter's saying she's
going to stay and live in this
village! What should I do!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277124</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私なしでなど、
うちの娘は到底
生きていけないというのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I told her there's no way
she can survive without
me, and yet, she still...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>56</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>私があちらの村、こちらの村へと
移動するのが娘には
気に入らなかったみたいなのです</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It seems my daughter didn't take
to my lifestyle of always moving
from one village to the next.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>58</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>独り立ちするとか
言い出して……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>"I'm going to set out on
my own," she told me...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>58</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>世界の色んなところへ行けて
喜んでると思ってたのに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>And here I was thinking, "She's
able to see all these different
places. She'll be so happy"...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>6</SpeakerId>
      <Id>58</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277132</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>わしの道具屋「スパイシー」じゃ！
ゆっくりご覧あれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This's my item shop, "Spicy"!
Relax and take a look around.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>61</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277136</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>_shop_</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>_shop_</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>62</Id>
      <Status>Done</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277140</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>御用入りなら、
またご来店するのじゃ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you ever need anything,
be sure to come back!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>63</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この辺りの家が
少し普通より高い位置にあるのは
なんでか知ってるかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do you know why the houses in these
parts sit a little higher than normal?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277144</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>砂で家が
埋まってしまうからだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>'Cause otherwise, they'd
be buried in the sand.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>64</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277148</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>何年か一度、
「砂どけ」をするんだけどね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You see, once every few
years, we do a "sand clearing."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>66</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277148</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いちいち、めんどうだから
少し家の位置を
高く持ち上げてるんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But it's always a pain,
so we started building
our houses a little higher.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>66</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どうして、砂漠の中に
オアシスがあるか
知ってるかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So, do you know why
there's an oasis out in
the middle of the desert?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>68</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277152</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それはこの辺りの地盤が
砂漠の他の場所と違って、
水を吸い上げるからなんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, the planet's crust around here is
a little different from the rest of the
desert's. It pushes the water upwards.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>68</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>中には人が井戸を掘った
ウソもののオアシスもあるらしいけど</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I've heard some oases are really just
wells people dug up. Artificial, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>70</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277156</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オリーブヴィレッジは
正真正銘本物のオアシスだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Olive Village's is the real deal.
This is an actual, genuine oasis.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>70</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>君たちは砂漠の中で
蜃気楼を見たことがあるかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Have you guys seen any mirages
while you've been in the desert?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>72</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277160</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>温度差の関係で光が歪んで、
遠くのものが近くに見える、
それが蜃気楼だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Mirages are caused by heat differentials
curving the light in the air, and making
distant things look like they're nearby.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>72</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>蜃気楼は海の上の
巨大なハマグリが見せる幻だとも
言われているね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Though, I've also heard it said that
mirages are illusions cast by giant
clams that live atop the ocean.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>74</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277164</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>まぁ、それは言い伝え、
なんだけどさ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, but that's just
a legend, y'know?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>74</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>暑い暑い……
外は暑いから、
このお店でひと休み</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's hot, so hot... It's hot
outside, so I'm taking
a little rest in here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>76</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277168</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>お店の人の視線が痛いけど
気にしちゃいられないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I feel like the staff are staring
bullets at me, but I'll just
have to ignore that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>76</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここんとこ
ずっとひと休みだけどね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Though, I *have* been
resting here a lot, lately.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>78</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277172</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいじゃないの、
人生忙しいんだから
たまにひと休みでも</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that's alright, isn't it? Life's
always so busy, so you gotta
take a break when you can.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>78</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひと休みひと休み……
だって疲れたんだもん、
人生に</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Just a rest, a little rest... I
mean, I'm tired. Life's tiring,
you know? You get me, right?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>80</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277176</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>仕事はもちろん休職中。
求職中じゃなくてね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm off of work, of
course. Not *laid* off of
work, though! Just off.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>80</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>長い人生
焦っても仕方ないって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a long life, so
there's no sense
trying to rush it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>82</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277180</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>この辺りでゆったりのんびりと
構えておきましょうって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll just keep chillin' out,
maxin', relaxin' around here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>82</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>暑い暑い……
この店、やっぱり涼しいね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's hot, so hot... But it's
always so cool in this shop.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>84</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277184</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>買うものはないけど、
お金もないけど、
いいよね、ちょっとくらい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>There's nothing I need to buy, and I
don't even have any money on me, but
hey, no big deal, I'll just vibe for a sec.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>84</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そろそろ本気を出すかなぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Maybe I should start taking
life a bit more seriously...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>86</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277188</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>バジリスクが絶滅したら
本気で仕事探すよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll start looking for a job once the
basilisks go extinct... Yeah, for real.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>86</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
